     "confidence": "documented",
     "note": "xEdit PACK PSDT: month -1 Any, 0-11 January-December, 12-15 Spring/Summer/Autumn/Winter (records of form version below 122 store it zero-based; FNV records are version 15); date 0 Any, else day of month; time -1 Any, else 0-23 hour"
